# Pure SaaS: /pure-saas polish

Raise visual and tactile craft quality of an existing implementation beyond basic functionality.

## Usage
Type `@pure-saas-polish [request]` or `/pure-saas polish [request]` in Composer or Chat.

## Instructions
1. Elevate typography: tighten heading tracking (`-0.02em`), restrict body measure (`max-w-[65ch]`), and use tabular numbers (`tabular-nums`) for metrics.
2. Refine surfaces: layered background depths (`color-bg-canvas`, `color-bg-surface`), crisp 1px borders, and subtle ambient shadows.
3. Harmonize nested corner radii (outer radius = inner radius + padding).
4. Add smooth tactile micro-interactions (150ms hover lift, active press scale, visible focus ring).
5. Preserve 100% of working backend APIs, routes, and business logic.
